OL,3,AChrista Pike's lawyers ask court for
OL,4,Aremoval of hospital bed shackles after
OL,5,Afailed execution
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike's lawyer tells the court she is
OL,8,Fspeaking but limitedly after regaining
OL,9,Fconsciousness on Tuesday and that a
OL,10,Frequest by medical staff to have her
OL,11,Fshackles removed has been denied
OL,13,FShe continues to receive care after
OL,14,Fsurviving two lethal doses of the drug
OL,15,Fpentobarbital - read more about what
OL,16,Fthis is
OL,18,FPike was sentenced to death following
OL,19,Fher conviction for murdering Colleen
OL,20,FSlemmer in 1995
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
